<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  Ode to Joy — the theme from the fourth movement of Beethoven's Ninth
  Symphony, arranged as a single-line melody for one hand.

  PROVENANCE. Beethoven died in 1827; the music is in the public domain
  worldwide. This MusicXML encoding was written by hand for Hogwash and is
  released under the same licence as the rest of the project (Apache-2.0),
  so nothing here depends on a third party's engraving, edition or typeset.

  That is the point of hand-encoding it. C-200 requires every provided piece
  to be verifiably redistributable, and a downloaded file — even of
  public-domain music — carries whatever licence its *encoder* attached.
  A file we wrote has no such question attached to it.
-->
